{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04247","headline":"冬日野望 · 骆宾王","name":"冬日野望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人无与晤，安步陟山椒。\n野静连云卷，川明断雾销。\n灵岩闻晓籁，洞浦涨秋潮。\n三江归望断，千里故乡遥。\n劳歌徒自奏，客魂谁爲招。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04247.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04247","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}